    <string name="serial_summary">Wire → patch: [r tty0]. Lines ON: each newline-terminated line is parsed — a println\'d number arrives as one float, "a 1 2" as a list, a word as a symbol. Lines OFF: every USB read chunk as a raw byte list (0–255). Patch → wire: [s TTY] with a byte value or list, values mod 256. 8N1.</string>
